s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107148.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Implements classic search in the Output (EditorLog) panel, including:\r\n- Search box with toggles for \"Match Case\" and \"Whole Words\"\r\n- Navigation buttons for next/previous match\r\n- Highlights matches, with distinction for the currently selected\r\n- Scroll to active match when navigating\r\n\r\nThis improves usability for developers debugging or scanning log output by allowing quick and flexible keyword searching. This looks to implement what was referenced in godot-proposals features  https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12074 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10249.\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: @SunChenWei\r\n\r\n<img width=\"993\" alt=\"dier\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8c7b032c-1dfe-452f-aeae-bc2d032e1407\" />\r\n<img width=\"1040\" alt=\"diyi\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1213e2e8-a588-4781-9650-ba05c84f619a\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10249* Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12074","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107148/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107148/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}